{"strongs": "H6089", "word": "עֶ֫צֶב", "translit": "e.tsev", "root": "עפר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "pain, hurt, toil", "definition": "I. עֶ֫צֶב noun [masculine] pain, hurt, toil ; — 1. ׳ ע pain Gen 3:16 (of travail), Prov 10:22 . 2. hurt (of mind), ׳ דְּבַרעֿ Prov 15:1 a word that hurts (opposed to מַעֲנֶהרַֿךְ ). 3. toil Prov 14:23 plural לֶחֶם הָעֲצָבִים Ps 127:2 bread of (gained by) toils ; suffix עֲצָבֶיךָ Prov 5:10 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6267')\">BDB6267</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6089')\">H6089</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6266')\">BDB6266</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6268')\">BDB6268</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>עֶ֫צֶב</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>pain, hurt, toil</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <highlight>pain</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,16)\">Gen 3:16</ref> (of travail), <ref ref=\"Prov 10:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,22)\">Prov 10:22</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>hurt</highlight> (of mind), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דְּבַרעֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 15:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,1)\">Prov 15:1</ref> <highlight>a word that hurts</highlight> (opposed to <bdbheb>מַעֲנֶהרַֿךְ</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>toil</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,23)\">Prov 14:23</ref> plural<bdbheb>לֶחֶם הָעֲצָבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 127:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"127\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"127\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,127,2)\">Ps 127:2</ref> <highlight>bread of</highlight> (gained by)<highlight> toils</highlight>; suffix <bdbheb>עֲצָבֶיךָ</bdbheb> <r